WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.592
Identify authorities at home, school and in the community

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:09.570
Authority: the recognised right to make decisions within a responsibility. Power: the

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.130
ability to influence actions or decisions.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:17.855
Rule of law: the principle that everyone must follow fair laws. Participation: having

00:00:17.855 --> 00:00:23.515
a voice in decisions that affect the group. Abuse of power: using authority to harm

00:00:23.515 --> 00:00:25.025
or unfairly control others.

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:30.389
Draw a chart showing one authority figure and a responsibility they should fulfil.
